  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A climber, grappler, or swimmer gets a final burst of strength on their Athletics check. This applies 1d4 to Athletics checks made by the character carrying the effect, once per turn.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
